{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rogue-Lite Factory Builder &quot;Lazy Witch's Factory&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a fantasy world set in hell and use magic to build a factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect the water current conveyor belts, give orders to cute familiars, and create products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a factory builder. However, it is not a leisurely sandbox game, rather a tight and busy run-based roguelike game where you must repay your debts within a time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your skills to find the path to victory amid varying resources and strategies available each run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lazy Witch's Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreaming of passive income, the lazy witch made a deal with the devil who rules hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In exchange, she gained the magical power to summon familiars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The price she paid was a huge debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaited Lazy Witch Momoko, now a slave to capital, was the intensely busy work of factory design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This wasn't supposed to happen, was it? Excuses won't make money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the lazy witch to build a factory, deliver products, and pay off the debt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summon, Command, Produce</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon familiars to collect and process resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, they have various issues that affect their productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use run-only-buffs and permanent unlock to overcome these issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971650/extras/0b392eb400a7d912e2278786d70f7881.avif?t=1756423873\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971650/extras/84f3e8412293d0375e383acdc65b6d29.avif?t=1756423873\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971650/extras/9485abfa8649dbd3f5fd490a36e5786d.avif?t=1756423873\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Patrons will help you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your debt bonds are being distributed like hot meat pies cut up by the Patrons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are powerful figures in hell, with the authority to make personnel decisions and enforce laws, and they will help you expand your factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear your orders and send out your familiars, and sign a pact to have them reprimanded for slacking off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971650/extras/0d0907d520c8b9cc35badccd3d80fc7d.avif?t=1756423873\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971650/extras/e76adeab6f550232fe222290b4dbe10a.avif?t=1756423873\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971650/extras/4fac9bfc24277d24a3714824758c3d68.avif?t=1756423873\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971650?t=1756423873","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971650/4b27c9a8b8ce7488369b239fa66a6275b5908ded/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756423873","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/