s, and pay off the debt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summon, Command, Produce</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon familiars to collect and process resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, they have various issues that affect their productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use run-only-buffs and permanent unlock to overcome these issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971650/extras/0b392eb400a7d912e2278786d70f7881.avif?t=1756423873\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971650/extras/84f3e8412293d0375e383acdc65b6d29.avif?t=1756423873\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971650/extras/9485abfa8649dbd3f5fd490a36e5786d.avif?t=1756423873\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Patrons will help you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your debt bonds are being distributed like hot meat pies cut up by the Patrons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are powerful figures in hell, with the authority to make personnel decisions and enforce laws, and they will help you expand your factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear your orders and send out your familiars, and sign a pact to have them reprimanded for slacking off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971650/extras/0d0907d520c8b9cc35badccd3d80fc7d.avif?t=1756423873\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971650/extras/e76adeab6f550232fe222290b4dbe10a.av